{"id": "86256", "name": "חילוק פולינומים – פונקציה לינארית ועוד שבר עם מכנה ריבועי (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Express</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>as a sum of a linear function and a rational function with a linear numerator and denominator {{CT:1}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The numerator is cubic and the denominator quadratic, so we divide: the quotient is the linear function and the remainder is the linear numerator.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The form of the answer</b><br>We note that the numerator {{CT:2}} is cubic and that the denominator {{CT:1}} is quadratic. Dividing {{CT:2}} by {{CT:1}} we obtain a quotient with a linear numerator of the form {{CT:3}} and a linear term of the form {{CT:4}}, that is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}=\\frac{{CT:5}}{{CT:6}}+{{CT:7}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Matching coefficients</b><br>Multiplying through by {{CT:1}}<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:8}} = ({{CT:6}})({{CT:7}})+{{CT:5}}. \\]</p>Expanding out the brackets we find<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:8}} = {{CT:9}}+{{CT:5}}. \\]</p>Matching coefficients in \\(x^3\\) we see \\(m={{CT:10}}\\). Matching coefficients in lower order terms and substituting we find that \\(n={{CT:11}}\\), \\(g={{CT:12}}\\) and \\(h={{CT:13}}\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The answer</b><br>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}={{CT:14}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "divide", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "answer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-IPF-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-IPF-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["answer", "aval", "bval", "cval", "den", "denq", "dval", "f", "gval", "hval", "mag_d", "mag_h", "mag_n", "mval", "num", "nval", "p", "q", "sign_d", "sign_h", "sign_n"], "nvariants": 50}